      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The town first appeared in 1821 as “Freedom,” carved from parts of Beekman and Fishkill.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        3
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/LaGrange%2C_New_York",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Freedom Park, the town’s largest, hosts a spring‑fed lake where Red‑Cross lifeguards supervise swims.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        17,
